{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadderAnchorDominanceChecks","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadderAnchorDominanceChecks","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadderAnchorDominance","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.leading_term_residual_dwarfs_full_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.leading_term_residual_dwarfs_full_form","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlphaEM/FormLadderAnchorDominanceChecks.lean#L98-L102","doc":"**The leading term alone misses by more than `5·10⁵×` the full form's\nproton-anchored residual** (measured ratio ≈ 9.3·10⁵). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.anchor_gap_dominates_proton_residual","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.anchor_gap_dominates_proton_residual","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlphaEM/FormLadderAnchorDominanceChecks.lean#L91-L96","doc":"**The anchor gap dominates the proton-anchored residual** — by more than\n`40×` on the recorded values (measured ratio ≈ 47).  The quantitative form of\n\"the pin choice is not bookkeeping\". ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.recorded_anchors_not_closed_by_affine","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.recorded_anchors_not_closed_by_affine","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlphaEM/FormLadderAnchorDominanceChecks.lean#L83-L89","doc":"**The generic exclusion, instantiated on the recorded pair.**  No affine\nanchor-blind correction with `s ≠ 0` brings the recorded proton and muon\npredictions together — `no_anchor_blind_affine_correction_closes_gap` at\n`R = ℝ` on `predictions_differ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.predictions_differ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.predictions_differ","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlphaEM/FormLadderAnchorDominanceChecks.lean#L79-L81","doc":"The two recorded predictions are distinct, so the generic exclusion applies. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.residLeadingOnlyPpb","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.residLeadingOnlyPpb","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlphaEM/FormLadderAnchorDominanceChecks.lean#L75-L77","doc":"Residual of the leading term `q[9]_q[10]_q` alone, in ppb — the figure that\nmust **not** be quoted as the form's accuracy. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.residMuonPpb","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.residMuonPpb","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlphaEM/FormLadderAnchorDominanceChecks.lean#L71-L73","doc":"Recorded muon-anchored residual, in ppb — live CODATA-2022 muon derivation,\nregenerated 2026-09-03 (the retired pin `A` gave 80.50996334188073). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.residProtonPpb","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.residProtonPpb","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlphaEM/FormLadderAnchorDominanceChecks.lean#L67-L69","doc":"Recorded proton-anchored residual, in ppb (regenerated 2026-09-03 from the\n50-digit proton string; the 19-figure literal gave 1.6723270482102428). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.refCodata","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.refCodata","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlphaEM/FormLadderAnchorDominanceChecks.lean#L51-L65","doc":"The reference value the witness scores against (CODATA-2018 Cs-recoil).\n\nCORRECTED 2026-09-04.  This docstring said the value \"must track\n`alpha-em-form-ladder.witness.json`\" — and that witness did not contain it.\n`137.035999084` appears nowhere in it; the only in-tree witnesses carrying it\nare under `fsh-guts/deprecated/computations/`.  The real source is the producer,\n`computations/alpha_em_form_ladder_probe.py::CODATA_ALPHA_INV`, and the witness\npublished `proton_ppb` / `muon_ppb` while recording no value for them to be\nresiduals FROM.  The producer now emits `data.codata_reference`, so the\noriginal sentence is true as of that regeneration.\n\nNot the live table: `137.035999177` is CODATA-2022, and bumping this alone\nwould desynchronise it from the recorded residuals.  Nothing consumes this\ndeclaration; it is here as a recorded provenance row. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.predMuon","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.predMuon","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlphaEM/FormLadderAnchorDominanceChecks.lean#L46-L49","doc":"Recorded fixed point at the muon anchor — live CODATA-2022 muon derivation,\nregenerated 2026-09-03 (owner authorisation, bean `qou-4bef`); the retired pin `A`\nvalue 137.036010116763 is history only.  See the module docstring. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.predProton","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlphaEM.FormLadder.Checks.predProton","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlphaEM/FormLadderAnchorDominanceChecks.lean#L43-L44","doc":"Recorded fixed point at the proton anchor (`alpha-em-form-ladder.witness.json`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}